# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# This is a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf off and no prior attributes,
# so line endings were unmanaged: files committed as a mix of LF and CRLF, and
# the working tree drifted to CRLF. That drift made otherwise-tiny edits show up
# as whole-file diffs. text=auto stores LF in the repo and normalizes on the fly
# so diffs stay clean; eol=lf checks out LF everywhere, Windows included.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never attempt a text diff.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.avif   binary
*.pdf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.eot    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.webm   binary
*.mov    binary
*.zip    binary
*.gz     binary
*.wasm   binary
